:INFO
Art. 23
The Board of Directors shall establish the following in the Funding Ordinance:
a. the funding instruments of Innosuisse;
b. the conditions for promotion and support;
bbis. the cases where contributions may be made to implementing partners in accordance with Article 19 paragraph 1bis RIPA;
bter. the criteria for determining the amount of the contributions to be made by start-ups and small and medium-sized enterprises themselves under Article 19 paragraphs 3bis and 3ter RIPA;
c. the procedure used to select service providers under Articles 20 paragraph 3 and 21 paragraph 2 RIPA;
d. the conditions and terms for granting subsidies to foreign research partners for cross-border innovation projects;
e. calculation of funding amounts and terms of payment.
|

:NOTE
let. bbis — Inserted by the annex of the FA of 17 Dec. 2021 (Changes to Innovation Promotion), in force since 1 Jan. 2023 (AS 2022 221; BBl 2021 480).
let. bbis — SR 420.1
let. bter — Inserted by the annex of the FA of 17 Dec. 2021 (Changes to Innovation Promotion), in force since 1 Jan. 2023 (AS 2022 221; BBl 2021 480).
let. c — Amended by the Annex to the FA of 17 Dec. 2021 (Changes in the Funding of Innovation), in force since 1 Jan. 2023 (AS 2022 221; BBl 2021 480).

